e" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Ready for the big, bad wolf? 5 RED JEWELS<br /><br />Destiny wants this, don’t you see? This was it. this was the mission of his life. A make-or-break moment. All raw, animal power that called to her, body and soul. Would the primal rhythm win out, or would reality come crashing back in? AARROOOO! WEREWOLVES OF MAUI!! What a PAWSITIVELY WOLFTACULAR book!! And a PAWFECT continuation of this MAUIGNIFICENT series!! WOW! This book is so different for lots of reasons, but the main one is because of Nina having no clue as to who she is! I loved how real it felt too! Between muscle memory, an almost sixth sense and the voices in her head, Nina finds herself doing things she isn't sure why, trusting someone she is sure she doesn't know and responding in ways she can't explain or articulate, but it all just. feels. right. Of course, there is one helluva Boone that's right there beside her, helping her, making her feel safe, so that makes all of it seem worthwhile! Too bad she doesn't know his Big Furry Secret! Too bad she doesn't know hers! But since she doesn't even remember her last name... This is one of those stories that had me holding my breath, swooning, cursing, howling with laughter, panting (outdoor shower scene!!) and even BAWLING a time or 3 too! Anna truly is one phenomenally talented &amp; naturally, genuinely gifted author who once again enhanced &amp; enriched her storytelling with lush, detailed descriptions that had me seeing the beautiful landscape &amp; iconic blue water, smelling the hibiscus, feeling the sand in my hands, grass in my toes, soft, plush fur against my face, just totally immersing me completely in the story! I love, Love, LOVE when the animal side is its own character and Anna gives him the ABSO-FURRY-LUTELY best WOLFALITY I have read in a VERY long time!! I was howling with laughter so many times!! I can't forget to mention all of the best parts of being a Shifter and all of the cool benefits that come with it! And that last bit that leads up to THE GRRRAND FURNALE?!? WHOA BABY!!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.75238209 C10.9999468,5.91477784 11.5910613,5.19356674 12.4123594,5.02913493 C13.3640475,4.8385978 14.290004,5.45563256 14.4813282,6.41129383 Z M8,11 L6,11 C5.44771525,11 5,11.4477153 5,12 L5,17 C5,17.5522847 5.44771525,18 6,18 L8,18 C8.55228475,18 9,17.5522847 9,17 L9,12 C9,11.4477153 8.55228475,11 8,11 Z M12.6086732,6.00967606 C12.2547259,6.08053973 11.9999771,6.39134718 12,6.75231863 L12,9.60363442 