 remember her last name, who she was, what she did for a living, and some very important details. She did remember bits and pieces of her mother though. I guess through the fear she had to be feeling that was one comfort she had. It was a comfort and a pain as well. <br /><br />I loved Boone in book one, so it was good to see this sexy wolf shifter find his mate. He was not willing to except it at first but piece by piece his wolf and friends helped him realize how important Nina was to him. <br /><br />As you are reading the story you will start trying to solve the mystery surround Nina in your mind. Let me tell you, you will be far off. I sure did not expect the secrets that surrounds Nina. <br /><br />We got to know a little more about more of Hunter and Cruz’s. I just love Hunter and can not wait to read book 3 about him. Cruz I got to see a small glimpse of some kindness. Silas who is this cracky dragon yea though it was small we got to see a little different side of him as well. I can only imagine what the story will be like for Silas and Cruz when they find their mate. Cruz is a loner who hates humans and Silas well he is just cranky..LOL <br /><br />Danger is just around the corner and enemies from the past will pop up. This will be a lot for Boone to handle but he has his friends and the love of his life. Thing is Nina”s hidden secrets that are deep locked in her mind can crush her and Boone. <br /><br />This was a great story and glad I took to time to read the story. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox