0877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1997698925">May 12, 2017</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Everyone has heard the old cliche "I need to find myself," and I'm sure most of us have had the same reaction...*rolls eyes* But for Nina, it's not a cliche, it's her reality. She knows her name and that's about it. Oh yeah, and that she's in danger.<br /><br />Boone is just minding his own business, enjoying the beach on his property when he discovers a mermaid has washed ashore. LOL Oh wait, false alarm, it's woman. One that definitely needs help.<br /><br />Though Boone knows Silas's stance on humans, he has reasons, he refuses to let Nina go through this alone. He wants to help, plus, he feels a connection for her and he can't figure out why.<br /><br />Nina feels it as well, but without her full memory, she doesn't know what awaits her at home. As she and Boone work together to uncover not only her identity, but also what happened to her and why, the attraction between them grows stronger, making it even harder to resist.<br /><br />As things begin to come together, giving a vague idea of who Nina is, Boone's past returns to haunt him in the form of his ex-girlfriend, as well as the man that betrayed them all. It seems as if they're interested in Nina too, and have someone with them to show their concern is sincere. *Hah, yeah right.*<br /><br />How will Boone react upon meeting someone from Nina's life? How is his past now connected with hers? Is it a coincidence? Or a plan to get what they want from Nina? Can Boone trust in Nina and his growing love for her? Can Nina accept Boone for who and what he is? Is she truly his mate? Or will a previous betrayal cloud his judgment and instincts? Is Nina safe? Who attacked her and why? Can Boone get to her in time or will he lose her forever? Is there a HEA for them?<br /><br />One-click now and follow along as two people discover a love so true that it can overcome any obstacle.<br /><br />**I voluntarily reviewed an Advanced Reader Copy of this book.**</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15