2L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined0small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2321357199">March 10, 2018</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">This second story in Aloha Shifters - Jewels of the Heart covers the romance between Boone the Wolf Shifter and amnesiac victim Nina who washes up on their beach. This story introduces several more villains as Nina and Boone work on the mystery of what happened to Nina and she recovers her memories slowly. The story has lots of mystery and adventure and another Spirit Stone makes an appearance. We get a small hint that the stones recognize each other, but more meaning to be uncovered in future books.<br /><br />One favourite part of story for me occurred after Nina first washed up on the beach and Boone was so reassuring and tender, protective and careful of her. Also got a foreshadowing that adorable gentle giant Bear Shifter Hunter will get his romance in next story with recurring Character Officer Meli.<br /><br />Also loved that female Mate Tessa from Book 1 appears at the end of this story and I am thrilled that the women also develop a telepathic connection. I also really liked that Nina's background perhaps fills a hole in the skill base and strengths in the whole group. (Can see some long term business potential for the women, perhaps). This will build long term a strong feminine power base as balance for this group of Alpha males. You can feel the now enlarged group is becoming family/pack/weyr as they tussle over what to call their group. <br /><br />Still loving the tropical beauty of Hawaii as a backdrop for the story - it is a refreshing change for a shifter stories. I highly recommend that Readers follow the link to sign up for Anna Lowe's Newsletter to access the Bonus Scene Epilogues. Story lost 1/2 star for me for several TSTL decisions. Final Rating: 3.5 Stars <br /><br />Gotta go, got a date with a Bear and Cop in Hawaii....<br /><br />I voluntarily reviewed the book gifted to me by the author with no obligation.<br /><br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=intrigue-suspense-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">intrigue-suspense-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=mystical-paranormal-magical" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">mystical-paranormal-magical</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=paranormal-animal-shifter" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal-animal-shifter</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><butto