e told their Leader Silas what was going on he said don't get involved take her to the police let them handle it. Boone thought about it and knew that he could never let her go she was his mate and when they made love they both knew that it was more than just sex they were meant to be but of coarse her so called husband comes in with Boone's worse enemy to drag her away. Late when she is in the car going she doesn't know where but she does know that the man she loves is back at the estate and where she wants to be she tries the door in the car and finds it is locked, Kramer the man her husband said worked for him told her she wasn't going anywhere and they went right passed the resort she had been staying in before she was attacked. She cries out for Boone in her mind. Boone takes a while to mourn his loss and feeling betrayed again it takes his brothers to help him come to his senses about his feelings for Nina. When he,Cruz and Hunter are off to find his woman and bring her back but it is not going to be easy. This is a very interesting romance suspense with a really good plot up until the end. I was given an Advanced Reader Copy for an honest review.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.49806