rom the previous books.<br /><br />Nina is washed up on the beach near Boone's home. She doesn't seem to remember what happened to cause her to be in the water, and only knows her first name. Boone, a wolf shifter, immediately feels a connection to the half-drowned waif. <br /><br />You will be astonished at the revelations about how Nina came to be in Hawaii, and what treasure she will bring to the table. Old enemies will soon show up to try and claim her, and Boone's ex-girlfriend will slither in and try to cause trouble. Nina will get some surprises as she learns to trust these close-knit ex-military men, perhaps the biggest of these will be that she wants to stay forever.<br /><br />Hunter's story will be next. You will know who his heart yearns for and wonder how the heck that is ever going to work out. Kai and Tessa will make an appearance at the end and the pack/clan/weyr will begin to resemble a family.<br /><br />I received a copy of this book from the author. My review is voluntary and from the heart. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=paranormal" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=romances" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">romances</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14