 (not to mention a chance to overcome her own inhibitions) and she'll never turn down the chance for adventure, nor shy away from danger.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOn any given weekend, you might find her hiking in the mountains or hunched over her laptop, working on her latest story. Either way, the day will end with a chunk of dark chocolate and a good read.","isGrAuthor":true,"works":{"__typename":"ContributorWorksConnection","totalCount":131},"profileImageUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/authors/1459872490i/4241741._UY200_CR55,0,200,200_.jpg","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/4241741.Anna_Lowe","viewerIsFollowing":null,"followers":{"__typename":"ContributorFollowersConnection","totalCount":503},"user":{"__ref":"User:38613208"}},"Series:kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.otFi6SBuJ3CLu9wO0kVzbQ":{"__typename":"Series","id":"kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.otFi6SBuJ3CLu9wO0kVzbQ","title":"Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/series/205049-aloha-shifters-jewels-of-the-heart"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8Mf9t7nSFRmnkCUeyj_AJw":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8Mf9t7nSFRmnkCUeyj_AJw","legacyId":34881982,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/34881982-lure-of-the-wolf","viewerShelving":null,"title":"Lure of the Wolf","titleComplete":"Lure of the Wolf (Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart #2)","description":"\u003cb\u003eShe can't remember her past. He wishes he could forget his.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNina only has the vaguest memories of who she is or why two men tried to kill her one terrifying night. All she knows is how quickly she's falling in love with her rescuer - a man with secrets of his own. With her, he's kind, gentle, and fun - but there's a ferocious, animal side to Boone and the group of Special Forces vets he shares an exclusive seaside estate with. Can Boone help her uncover the past before the killers catch up with her?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIf fate were to come knocking on the door of Boone Hawthorne's beach bungalow, he'd shove it right back into the sea - especially if it started whispering any nonsense about destined mates. But one night, a woman washes up on his private stretch of beach. Before the wolf shifter knows it, he's breaking every personal rule for her and making promises he's not sure he can keep. Investigating Nina's past means crossing paths with a powerful archenemy, cutthroat criminals, and a ruthlessly selfish ex-lover who will stop at nothing to get Boone back in her bed. Can he protect Nina - and his heart - while solving the mystery of her identity?","description({\"stripped\":true})":"She can't remember her past. He wishes he could forget his.Nina only has the vaguest memories of who she is or why two men tried to kill her one terrifying night. All she knows is how quickly she's falling in love with her rescuer - a man with secrets of his own. With her, he's kind, gentle, and fun - but there's a ferocious, animal side to Boone and the group of Special Forces vets he shares an exclusive seaside estate with. Can Boone help her uncover the past before the killers catch up with her?If fate were to come knocking on the door of Boone Hawthorne's beach bungalow, he'd shove it right back into the sea - especially if it started whispering any nonsense about destined mates. But one night, a woman washes up on his private stretch of beach. Before the wolf shifter knows it, he's breaking every personal rule for her and making promises he's not sure he can keep. Investigating Nina's past means crossing paths with a powerful archenemy, cutthroat criminals, and a ruthlessly selfish ex-lover who will stop at nothing to get Boone back in her bed. Can he protect Nina - and his heart - while solving the mystery of her identity?","primaryContributorEdge":{"__typename":"BookContributorEdge","node":{"__ref":"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.imyoj