ůže od knihy očekávat. Pokud se pak toto očekávání propojí s autorem, jehož způsob psaní vám vyhovuje, je nasnadě, že nebudete zklamaní. Já po tomto typu knih sahám ve chvíli, kdy si potřebuji odpočinout a cítím se zahlcena příběhy jiných žánrů. Mám tak jistotu, že mě čeká nenáročný, oddechový příběh, který zaujme a bude mě bavit. Nejinak tomu bylo i v případě této knihy.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3E9LLGNN5R3EA\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.Z-8HeFWcd0aBEDZJ\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:7297738":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":7297738,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1515203180i/7297738._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":143,"name":"Colleen","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/7297738-colleen","contributor":null,"id":7297738},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7297738?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1998158119"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.fdpeisoyZIOLA5FgFiHnDg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.fdpeisoyZIOLA5FgFiHnDg","creator":{"__ref":"User:7297738"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1494957086835,"createdAt":1494603076439,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1494603095169,"text":"This is such a fun series - I love the setting and the “Magnum PI” feel of things. (If you haven’t read the first book, “Lure of the Dragon”, it’s about Kai. You don’t have to read it to understand or enjoy this book, but it’s a lot of fun.)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBoone is a Wolf Shifter, and a really good guy. He’s been used and betrayed so he’s not interested in finding a mate, because women cannot be trusted. And then he finds Nina washed up on the beach and he just can’t keep himself from helping her. Silas, leader of his group, insists that the woman be handed off to the local police, but Boone just can’t do it, and Nina’s too afraid to leave his side.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNina is a likeable, sweet person. There's a lot of mystery in this book all centered on the question: who tried to kill Nina, and why? She can't remember exactly what happened or her immediate past, which puts an interesting twist on things. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWith no memories to draw on, Nina has to rely on her instincts and feelings to guide her; Boone has to allow himself to trust that Nina is being honest with him. Even though he and his inner Wolf recognize her as their Fated Mate, it's not easy for Boone to trust what his Wolf is telling him.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe action and suspense in this episode of \"Aloha Shifters\" really kept me on the edge of my seat. The opening scene is terrifically scary, like the explosive opening scene of an action movie. During the climax of the story, I could feel Nina's panic, fear, and confusion. I wanted to shake Boone and yell at him, \"WHAT ARE YOU DOING?! DON'T LET HER GO!\" What a rollercoaster!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs always, there’s a fair amount of “heat” in this book as well as some violence, but never fear, there’s no cliffhangers, and definitely a happy ending. The characters are interesting, and the story well told. If you like steamy Fated Love, suspense, and complex heroes who can turn into animals, you cannot go wrong with an Anna Lowe shifter story.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:44632540":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":44632540,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1737411697i/44632540._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":18,"textReviewsCount":489,"name":"Melinda","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/44632540-melinda","contributor":null,"id":44632540},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ARNFW792RB7F":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ARNFW792RB7F"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.xx03_rgSGblMMe8i1mPgnA":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.xx03_rgSGblMMe8i1mPgnA"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ARNFW792RB7F\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.xx03_rgSGblMMe8i1mPgnA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ARNFW792RB7F","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ARNFW792RB7F"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.xx03_rgSGblMMe8i1mPgnA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.xx03_rgSGblMMe8i1mPgnA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/44632540?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2030750254"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1._IZUvYnt4z1_48MC8FpPdw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1._IZUvYnt4z1_48MC8FpPdw","creator":{"__ref":"User:44632540"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1497927771128,"createdAt":1497589471944,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1497927770267,"text":"This sequel makes me really want to visit Hawaii!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall: 5 stars\u003cbr /\u003ePerformance: 4 stars\u003cbr /\u003eStory: 5 stars\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am a fan of Ms. Lowe’s stories and have read/listened to several of her books. I love how she weaves the story elements together and makes it easy to picture the characters, locations and emotions. In fact, she did such a fantastic job of describing the location that I am wishing I could visit Maui this summer instead of sometime in the distant future.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe narrator, Ms. Osbourne, did well with the various characters voices and emotions. This is the 4th or 5th story I’ve listened to her narrate and I have truly come to enjoy her narration style. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhile the story does start off with the age-old trope of amnesia, I didn’t find it as annoying as I generally do. I think it was executed well and was easy to believe. The other elements of the story were well done too. I loved mystery of who was trying to harm Nina and why. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved how Boone and Nina clicked with one another. Granted it was insta-lust \u0026amp; insta-love, but that’s a typical shifter trope, but like the amnesia it was well executed. The characters actually considered why the loved one another. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe supporting cast was great as well. I am definitely looking forward to reading/listening to Hunter and Dawn’s story. I love those two characters! Books 1 and 2 of this series have set their story up well. It’s going to be interesting since they characters are not strangers, but have been dancing around their attraction for quite some time. Oh, and I’m looking forward to Cruz’s story in book 4. I like the growly tiger.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDisclosure: I received a free copy of the audible version of the book.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ARNFW792RB7F\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.xx03_rgSGblMMe8i1mPgnA\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:6650641":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":6650641,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":454,"name":"Lynda","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/6650641-lynda","contributor":null,"id":6650641},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A37TL3PF552YKS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A37TL3PF552YKS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37TL3PF552YKS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A37TL3PF552YKS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A37TL3PF552YKS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6650641?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2025008995"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.z9krznjsQCga6rYHkGC_-w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.z9krznjsQCga6rYHkGC_-w","creator":{"__ref":"User:6650641"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1497063101977,"createdAt":1497062880975,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1497062894710,"text":"3.5 stars","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37TL3PF55