},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27383555?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"phenomenal-and-fantastic","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27383555?shelf=phenomenal-and-fantastic"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1998132571"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xJwRqpmFX4psbTWAoUBMpg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xJwRqpmFX4psbTWAoUBMpg","creator":{"__ref":"User:27383555"},"recommendFor":"Everyone ","updatedAt":1494601234572,"createdAt":1494601024724,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1494601234572,"text":"Lure of the Wolf Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart Book 2\u003cbr /\u003eby Anna Lowe \u003cbr /\u003e⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003eWhat a Phenomenal read that I absolutely adored. Each book in this series is exciting, delicious and unforgettable with the hottest Shifters you have ever read and you will want to fall in love with Kai,Boone, Hunter, Cruz and Silas, They are all elite corps of shifter bodyguards and private investigators and for them nothing is off limits except falling in love especially with humans. One night as Boone walked on the beach he came up on a women laying half on the beach half in the sea. His wolf is immediately attracted to Nina his favorite word being mine, mate. But they have a rule no humans. Boone precedes to pick Nina up and carry her to his cottage. After making sure she didn't have any broken bones just the bump on her head. Boone ask her what her name was but she look blankly at him and she started to panic because she couldn't remember her own name. I am so captivated by this story, trying to figure out what would happen next. Its so intriguing, and engaging but a excellent read. This is the second book in this series written by Anna Lowe is awesome and exciting. The story continues involving three of the five brothers in arms, who are retired from the military and at first they are at odds with their lives, but Silas gathered them together forming a pack/ clan or weyr it's a touche subject of what they should call their group, but old habits die hard as Silas was their leader in the military and when they set up their cover as a exclusive private investigator/bodyguard agency. Silas knows the owner of their retreat or as they call it house sitting for a rich benefactor and he is the leader of their group, which comprises of two dragons, a wolf, a tiger and a bear, Silas tells them they don’t need to look for trouble, because trouble seems to find them all right. Their adventures continue, Boone is a wolf shifter whose past has comeback to visit him. Nina is his mate and their emotions with the danger to defeat the evil that's after her is exciting and puts you on the edge of your seat. WOW there's secrets, action, romance, suspense, mystery and passion what more can you want from a magnificent story. I enjoy and love reading Anna Lowe stories they are always entertaining, full of mystery and intrigue. You will want to buy this book and buckle up! The ride is more than worth it! What a awesome romantic read that I highly recommend. I voluntarily reviewed this book, because I like sharing my thoughts with my fellow readers.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1NZZ3AK63D7ZY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.LW-Xlgu90NUth3S-XdPGEA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:13055353":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":13055353,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":8,"textReviewsCount":282,"name":"Bernadette","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/13055353-bernadette","contributor":null,"id":13055353},"User:kca://profile:go